  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a large saucepan with water, add a generous pinch of salt, then bring to the boil over high heat.\n• Cook penne in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 12 minutes.\n• Reserve pasta water(see ingredients). Drain penne, then return to saucepan with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688957e8b6ffa7a20c3beab7/step-da5e2a00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, preheat grill to high.\n• Roughly chop tomato.\n• Finely chop brown onion (see ingredients) and garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688957e8b6ffa7a20c3beab7/step-bb24f210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook sliced mushrooms and onion, until browned and softened, 6-8 minutes.\n• Add herb & mushroom seasoning and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688957e8b6ffa7a20c3beab7/step-e3de6020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium, then stir in light cooking cream, the reserved pasta water and stock concentrate. Simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir through cooked penne, baby spinach leaves and Parmesan cheese until wilted and combined, 1 minute. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688957e8b6ffa7a20c3beab7/step-66f17230.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer pasta to a baking dish.\n• Tear over double cream Brie and evenly top with tomato.\n• Grill until cheese is slightly melted and gooey, 5-8 minutes.\n• TIP: Grills cook fast, so keep an eye on the pasta!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688957e8b6ffa7a20c3beab7/step-27446a40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide baked Brie and loaded veggie pasta between bowls to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688957e8b6ffa7a20c3beab7/step-7d3dcf50.jpg"
    }
  ]
